# [OPUS-4.8] LUBM Q13 — ENTAILED (owl:inverseOf + rdfs:subClassOf). People who are an alumnus of
# University0. The data asserts <person> degreeFrom University0 (via the *DegreeFrom subprops);
# ub:hasAlumnus is the INVERSE of degreeFrom, so University0 hasAlumnus <person> only exists
# after inverse-property reasoning. ub:Person also needs the subclass closure. 0 without
# reasoning. (Inverse handling is the LUBM feature most engines skip — this query tests it.)
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX ub: <http://swat.cse.lehigh.edu/onto/univ-bench.owl#>
SELECT ?x WHERE {
  ?x rdf:type ub:Person .
  <http://www.University0.edu> ub:hasAlumnus ?x .
}
